     },
     "iconUrl": "https://static.skport.com/image/common/20251112/e71d9a4adf520e753a11d06c3f0102dc.png",
     "desc": "Throws a freezing bomb. The bomb explodes when it hits the enemy to deal <@ba.cryst>Cryo DMG</>. If hitting an enemy with <#ba.crystinflict>Cryo Infliction</> or <#ba.naturalinflict>Nature Infliction</>, then <#ba.consume>consume</> all <#ba.spellinflict>Arts Infliction</> stacks, forcibly apply <#ba.frozen>Solidification</>, and deal <@ba.cryst>Cryo DMG</> to the target based on the number of stacks <#ba.consume>consumed</>.\nAfter the battle skill successfully applies <#ba.frozen>Solidification</>, Yvonne gains additional Ultimate Energy based on the number of stacks <#ba.consume>consumed</>. This Ultimate Energy Gain effect can only trigger 1 time, even if the skill hits multiple enemies.",
